  "title": "Refer friends, gift subscriptions, and never pay for NewsBlur premium again",
  "summary": "<p>If you’ve been following along lately, you know NewsBlur has been shipping feature after feature: story clustering, timed feed muting, the new site discovery panel, Ask AI, and more. I’m not slowing down, and I want people to know about it. If you’ve been using NewsBlur for years and still love it, tell people. Post about it on LinkedIn, on X, on Facebook, on Instagram, on TikTok, wherever you hang out online. Word of mouth is still king, and it’s how NewsBlur has always grown.</p> To make...",
